      "title": "Citi ThankYou 40% Transfer Bonus to Turkish Airlines Miles & Smiles (1:1.4)",
      "summary": "Doctor of Credit reports a 40% transfer bonus from Citi ThankYou points to Turkish Airlines Miles & Smiles. Normally 1,000 Citi ThankYou points transfer to 1,000 Miles & Smiles; with the bonus, that becomes 1,400. The promotion is listed for Nov. 1–30, 2026, Türkiye time (UTC+3), with a 50,000-bonus-mile cap. Not officially confirmed.",
      "verification": "reported",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-04T19:28:44.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
