      "sourceRunId": "18853a5a-e6b6-4dfe-94f1-1944d31a1389",
      "changeType": "new",
      "active": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Doctor of Credit reports that Citi ThankYou points normally transfer to Turkish Airlines Miles & Smiles at 1:1, and the current bonus raises that to 1:1.4. That means 1,000 ThankYou points would produce 1,400 Miles & Smiles during the promotion. The report says the bonus is capped at 50,000 bonus miles.",
        "The reported window is Nov. 1 through Nov. 30, 2026, using Türkiye time (UTC+3). Doctor of Credit also notes that 50% transfer bonuses were seen in the previous two years and earlier this year, while this offer is 40%. This has not been officially confirmed."
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "40% bonus on Citi ThankYou transfers to Turkish Airlines Miles & Smiles",
        "1,000 ThankYou points converts to 1,400 Miles & Smiles instead of 1,000",
        "Runs Nov. 1–30, 2026 (Türkiye time, UTC+3), capped at 50,000 bonus miles"
      ],
      "takeaway": "If you plan a Turkish Airlines award, transfer during the bonus window and verify the 1:1.4 rate and remaining 50,000-bonus-mile cap in your Citi ThankYou account before moving points."
